    "frontend:api-client::access_card_contract::api-module::70253be159a1dd60": {
      "id": "frontend:api-client::access_card_contract::api-module::70253be159a1dd60",
      "unit_id": "frontend:api-client",
      "owner": "frontend",
      "task_type": "frontend.code",
      "status": "pending",
      "title": "实现门禁卡归还接口模块 accessCardContractApi.ts",
      "description": "在 frontend/src/apis/accessCardContractApi.ts 中实现 access_card_contract 契约下的两个前端业务访问函数，全部 HTTP 调用复用平台提供的 frontend/src/apis/service.ts，不得自建 axios/fetch 封装。\n\n1) 分页查询本人使用中门禁卡列表：\n   - 导出类型接口 AccessCardItem { id: string; name: string; employeeNo: string; cardNo: string; permissionStatus: string; cancellationApplication?: string }；\n   - 导出类型接口 AccessCardPageResponse { total: number; pageSize: number; current: number; list: AccessCardItem[] }；\n   - 导出常量 DEFAULT_ACCESS_CARD_PAGE_PARAMS = { current: 1, pageSize: 10 }；\n   - 导出异步函数 listAccessCards(params?: Partial<{ current: number; pageSize: number }>): Promise<AccessCardPageResponse>，默认取 current=1、pageSize=10，以 GET /api/access-cards?current=..&pageSize=.. 调用，返回 { total, pageSize, current, list } 结构，list 元素包含 id/name/employeeNo/cardNo/permissionStatus 及可选 cancellationApplication。\n\n2) 发起离职注销申请：\n   - 导出类型接口 CancelAccessCardRequest（按后端 CancelAccessCardRequest 约定承载待注销门禁卡标识字段，如 id 必填，其余字段按契约可选）；\n   - 导出异步函数 applyCancellation(payload: CancelAccessCardRequest): Promise<AccessCardItem>，以 PATCH /api/access-cards/cancellation 提交 JSON 请求体，返回更新后的门禁卡信息 { id, name, employeeNo, cardNo, permissionStatus, cancellationApplication? }。\n\n两个函数均需透传后端统一响应封装中的错误（UNAUTHORIZED / NOT_FOUND / INVALID_STATE），不做吞错式降级；函数需具名导出、带完整 TypeScript 类型标注，便于 CardReturn 页面直接引用。",
      "dependencies": [],
      "can_run_in_parallel": false,
      "parallel_reason": "任务涉及共享文件或公共契约，由对应受限执行器串行写入。",
